    "marble_url": "https://marble.worldlabs.ai/world/d3da8790-0566-46f9-bff8-0c080edda078",
    "caption": "The scene is a realistic panoramic view of an immense limestone quarry, rendered with crisp natural detail and a calm, work-stilled atmosphere. Its mood is open and monumental, shaped by pale stone, broad sky, and the quiet geometry of excavation. The quarry forms a vast amphitheater of stepped benches cut into cream and beige rock, each ledge running in long horizontal bands around the pit. Gravel haul roads loop along these terraces and connect through switchbacks that wind from the rim down toward the broad floor, their pale surfaces marked by compacted dust and shallow tire-traced ridges. Near the center of the excavation, sloped mounds of loose aggregate rise between the roads, their surfaces feathered with sparse grass and scrub. A simple bench rests on one of the lower levels, set beside the road on a flattened shelf, giving the impression of a solitary stopping place within the scale of the pit. A small rectangular concrete utility structure stands on the floor near a cluster of low shrubs, its flat roof and plain walls contrasting with the rough fractured stone around it. Along one side of the pit floor, a dark patch of crushed rock lies in a neat irregular bed, separated from the paler dust by a sharp edge. The quarry walls show layered textures, with vertical scrape marks and broken faces alternating with cleaner cut terraces, revealing the sedimentary character of the limestone. Around the entire upper rim, dense woodland gathers in deep green masses, softening the hard edge of the excavation and enclosing the site with continuous trees. The land beyond the quarry continues as rolling forest, while overhead the blue sky carries scattered white clouds that mirror the breadth and stillness of the open cut. The 360 scene is faultless.",
    "model": null
  }
